{"id":1996,"date":"2017-03-11T22:56:36","date_gmt":"2017-03-12T06:56:36","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=1996"},"modified":"2018-08-15T01:34:06","modified_gmt":"2018-08-15T01:34:06","slug":"6-year-anniversary-of-the-japan-tsunami-of-march-11-2011-you-tube-video","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2017\/03\/11\/6-year-anniversary-of-the-japan-tsunami-of-march-11-2011-you-tube-video\/","title":{"rendered":"6 Year Anniversary of the Japan Tsunami of March 11, 2011 You Tube Video"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>A few years ago I had the pleasure of visiting Japan and met some great people.\u00a0 I found they share one of the same concerns those of use who live California have&#8230;the ever present chance of an earthquake.\u00a0 On March 11, 2011 they had a magnitude 9 earthquake that shook northeastern Japan and unleashed a massive tsunami.\u00a0 In researching the catastrophe that followed I came across a You Tube video that shows how the tsunami unfolded in real time in a city called <span class=\"srTitle\">Kesennuma located in<\/span> northeastern Miyagi prefecture, northern Honshu, Japan.<\/p>\n<div id=\"attachment_345276\" style=\"width: 610px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-345276\" data-attachment-id=\"345276\" data-permalink=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2017\/03\/11\/6-year-anniversary-of-the-japan-tsunami-of-march-11-2011-you-tube-video\/kesennuma-school\/\" data-orig-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-School.jpg?fit=1244%2C833\" data-orig-size=\"1244,833\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Kesennuma-School\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-medium-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-School.jpg?fit=300%2C201\" data-large-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-School.jpg?fit=600%2C402\" class=\"wp-image-345276 size-large\" src=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-School.jpg?resize=600%2C402\" alt=\"Kesennuma located in northeastern Miyagi prefecture, northern Honshu, Japan.\" width=\"600\" height=\"402\" srcset=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-School.jpg?resize=1024%2C686 1024w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-School.jpg?resize=300%2C201 300w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-School.jpg?resize=768%2C514 768w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-School.jpg?w=1244 1244w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><p id=\"caption-attachment-345276\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kesennuma located in northeastern Miyagi prefecture, northern Honshu, Japan.<\/p><\/div>\n<p>The below two Google Earth photos is a close up of the Kesennuma School area before and after tsunami.<\/p>\n<div id=\"attachment_345279\" style=\"width: 610px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-345279\" data-attachment-id=\"345279\" data-permalink=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2017\/03\/11\/6-year-anniversary-of-the-japan-tsunami-of-march-11-2011-you-tube-video\/kesennuma-before\/\" data-orig-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-Before.jpg?fit=1588%2C926\" data-orig-size=\"1588,926\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Kesennuma-Before\" data-image-description=\"&lt;p&gt;Google Earth satellite picture near the Kesennuma School before the March 11, 2011 Earthquake and tusnami.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Google Earth satellite picture near the Kesennuma School before the March 11, 2011 Earthquake and tusnami.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-medium-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-Before.jpg?fit=300%2C175\" data-large-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-Before.jpg?fit=600%2C350\" class=\"size-large wp-image-345279\" src=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-Before.jpg?resize=600%2C350\" alt=\"Google Earth satellite picture near the Kesennuma School before the March 11, 2011 Earthquake and tusnami.\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\" srcset=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-Before.jpg?resize=1024%2C597 1024w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-Before.jpg?resize=300%2C175 300w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-Before.jpg?resize=768%2C448 768w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-Before.jpg?w=1588 1588w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/Kesennuma-Before.jpg?w=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><p id=\"caption-attachment-345279\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Google Earth satellite picture near the Kesennuma School before the March 11, 2011 Earthquake and tusnami.<\/p><\/div>\n<div id=\"attachment_345278\" style=\"width: 610px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-345278\" data-attachment-id=\"345278\" data-permalink=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2017\/03\/11\/6-year-anniversary-of-the-japan-tsunami-of-march-11-2011-you-tube-vid