11 Earthquake and tusnami.<\/p><\/div>\n<p>When you examine the above 2 pictures you may want to go to Google Earth and look in greater detail at the surrounding area.\u00a0 The images are startling.\u00a0 It is worth looking at other Google Earth photos of the same area since it shows how slow recovery can be&#8230;<\/p>\n<p>The videographer was near the Kesennuma School when it all began and did an amazing job of capturing the tsunami as it unfolded.\u00a0 To view the amazing 26 minute video click below&#8230;<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Tsunami in Kesennuma city, ascending the Okawa river\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/P8qFi74k2UE?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A few years ago I had the pleasure of visiting Japan and met some great people.\u00a0 I found they share one of the same concerns those of use who live <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2017\/03\/11\/6-year-anniversary-of-the-japan-tsunami-of-march-11-2011-you-tube-video\/\">Continue Reading &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":true,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[2],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1996","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-ccra-news"],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/p69ory-wc","_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/w